# Auction Hunter

Treat `/AGENTS.md` as the canonical instruction set for this repository. Before editing, inspect the relevant nested `AGENTS.md` and source-of-truth docs.

Key constraints:
- keep economy/content data-driven;
- keep pure game rules inside `src/domain` and inject randomness there;
- keep Yandex SDK access inside `src/platform`;
- keep persistence behind the store/save boundary;
- preserve RU/EN localization;
- do not rename persisted IDs without migration planning;
- run `npm run typecheck`, `npm test` and `npm run build` for functional changes;
- run `npm run qa:browser` for browser/UI changes;
- do not claim validation passed unless it was executed.
